\n5. **Final answer:**\n   The sum of the digits in the terminating decimal representation of the fraction is:\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{14}\n   \\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{14}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
